# Naming Policy

Consistent names reduce search cost and merge conflicts. **Read surrounding files before inventing new patterns.**

## Files & folders

| Kind | Convention | Example |
|------|------------|---------|
| Route folders | `kebab-case` | `online-courses/`, `contact/` |
| Lib folders | `camelCase` or domain word | `schemaTypes/`, `cms/` |
| React components | `PascalCase.tsx` | `CourseHeroSection.tsx` |
| Lib modules (multi-word) | `kebab-case.ts` | `nested-children.ts` |
| Lib modules (single) | lowercase word | `page.ts`, `paths.ts`, `urls.ts` |
| Scripts | `kebab-case.mjs` | `migrate-sanity-fields.mjs` |
| Config (root) | framework convention | `next.config.ts`, `server.config.cjs` |
| Private route UI | `_components/` folder | `_components/ContactForm.tsx` |
| URL segments | `kebab-case` | `/online-courses`, `/posts` |

## Code symbols

| Kind | Convention | Example |
|------|------------|---------|
| React components | `PascalCase` | `PageHeader`, `ContentCard` |
| Functions | `camelCase`, verb-first | `getCmsPage`, `buildNestedSlugMetadata` |
| Event handlers | `handle` + event | `handleSubmit`, `handleSearch` |
| React hooks | `use` + PascalCase | `useMenuOpen` (if extracted) |
| Booleans | `is` / `has` / `can` prefix | `isLoading`, `hasChildren` |
| Constants (frozen config) | `SCREAMING_SNAKE` | `CACHE_TAGS`, `STATIC_ROUTES` |
| Types / interfaces | `PascalCase`, noun | `CourseDetail`, `SiteSettings` |
| Enums / unions | `PascalCase` type, lowercase values | `ContactPurpose = "general" \| "course"` |
| Sanity `_type` | `camelCase` | `contactSubmission`, `homepageSettings` |
| Sanity fields | `camelCase`, full words | `faqItems`, `ctaPrimaryLabel`, `seo` |
| Env vars | `SCREAMING_SNAKE` | `NEXT_PUBLIC_SANITY_PROJECT_ID` |

## CMS field naming (canonical)

Use migrated names — never reintroduce legacy:

`faqItems` · `faqHeading` · `seo` · `ctaPrimaryLabel` · `ctaSecondaryLabel` · `description`

Routes: `/posts` not `/articles`.

## Imports & exports

- Path alias **`@/`** always — no `../../../`.
- **Named exports** for components and helpers.
- **Default export** only for Next.js `page.tsx`, `layout.tsx`, `loading.tsx`, `error.tsx`.
- One primary export per component file (the component name matches filename).

## Sanity / GROQ

- Query constants: `{entity}{Purpose}Query` — `courseBySlugDeepQuery`, `topLevelCoursesQuery`.
- Fragments in `fragments.ts`: `{NAME}_FRAGMENT` — `SEO_FRAGMENT`, `PARENT_ANCESTRY_FRAGMENT`.
- Schema files: match `_type` name — `course.ts` → `name: "course"`.

## Avoid

- Generic file names: `utils.ts`, `helpers.ts`, `data.ts`, `common.ts`.
- Abbreviations except standard: `cms`, `seo`, `url`, `id`, `cta`, `og`.
- Hungarian notation: `strName`, `objSettings`.
- Duplicate type names — extend shared types in `types/`.
- Renaming for style only in unrelated PRs — rename when touching the file for feature work.
